menu "HiYaKa PCA diagnostic safety"

config HI_YAKA_PCA_STRAPS_FIXED
    bool "Confirm PN532 mode straps are physically fixed before any I2C trial"
    default n
    help
        The c0 sample previously had R73/R74 removed and floating PN532 mode
        inputs. Leave this disabled until the physical strap state is fixed
        and recorded. The default image only logs HOLD and performs no bus
        transaction.

endmenu
